<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-GOV'T GUARANTEES 250 MLN LITAS IN CREDITS.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-GOV'T GUARANTEES 250 MLN LITAS IN CREDITS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Lithuanian government said on Thursday that the cabinet decided to issue state guarantees of up to 250 million litas for the country's banks which will issue credits to milk and grain producers.</p>
<p>The move was necessary since the grain processing companies were short of capital to pay producers, the government said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
